  "title": "Revolutionizing Drones with Gemini APU",
  "summary": "In Episode 8 of our podcast, we dive deep into the world of true autonomy at the edge, powered by GSI Technology‘s Gemini® APU. From navigating dense cities to seeing through storms and darkness with Synthetic Aperture Radar (SAR), to running multimodal LLMs on-board, this chip is redefining what’s possible for autonomous systems. Revolutionizing Drones […] The post Revolutionizing Drones with Gemini APU appeared first on GSI Technology .",
